      "side": 1,
      "message": "`DWRITE_COLOR_F` is `D3DCOLORVALUE`: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/directwrite/dwrite-color-f\n\n`D3DCOLORVALUE` is a POD struct of floats: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/direct3d9/d3dcolorvalue\n\nWhy do we need braces around each element? What was the warning?",
      "revId": "431db0979e3a8dee2a401e4ad047fdd620de31f8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
